{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f13001aa3ad6e65875ba48c0ec2e81fe1dced09b86c22651619acdc4a420414d", "ja": "（真美の新しい衣装の様子を見に来たのだが、\nなんだか、真美の様子がおかしいような……？）", "zh": "（我来看真美新服装的状况，\n但真美的样子感觉不太对劲……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "05d52e742591b4db78bb2f2171f5bedb4f92089631ca3f6fc73996a04e31d846", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "啊，大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1af52ba5371d18b7bf08a8b9df93062b4a04a3bd8342dcdcb6dfb413e892a490", "ja": "って、なんだその悲しそうな顔は？\n真美、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "咦？你怎么看起来很难过的样子？\n真美，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "2c7321701742c19f9b9b45354888a4f29f38693f28806b1b79079923fc29cf72", "ja": "どうもしないよ、兄ちゃん。\n真美はただ……。", "zh": "大哥哥，什么都没发生。\n只是真美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "edbdc30ec07996470d8fd39e93ddc9a4bb543952538fb34957901ca53f415ad5", "ja": "オトナになっちまったのさ……。", "zh": "变成大人了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "68bb6d2f542615aa3edd075f8b5030653aa9b616bbb25b8723bfe2c50ab16789", "ja": "……いや、そうは見えないが。\nで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "……呃，我看起来不像啊。\n到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "cf12615a7cf8f0f451e8d217f1f8a7227d8df0fb8457143a06899186c4d8698c", "ja": "うん……。なんかね、真美、この衣装を着た真美を\n見てると、ヘンな感じになるんだ～。", "zh": "嗯……就是啊，真美看到真美穿上这套服装以后，\n就有种奇怪的感觉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6778eef055a7b51aa186bb8a0a7fc7f29259795f8fc3568ca50395cbb76c3035", "ja": "ヘンな感じ……というと？", "zh": "奇怪的感觉……怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "efb6c8c5599d15bcec5acb4d73e2b21e5d9d1da119c4cd33249ac8e55e78d9b0", "ja": "なんか、元気が出ないっていうか～。", "zh": "感觉自己没有什么活力～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0e62d08ca15864bdd433bb3a0c3e140e1ff55e2e3e665bf3ad22dc850458d409", "ja": "えっ！？\nまさか、具合でも悪くなるとか？", "zh": "咦！？\n是会让你觉得不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "93e9e6cf16f9dd3115ab8e8d42272a340546dc4196ea54dd53fe5531e55d5e76", "ja": "ううん、出ないっていうか、出したくなくなるの。\nなんか、おとなしくおしとやかにしてたくなって……。", "zh": "不是，与其说是没有活力，更像是不想拿出活力。\n感觉自己想变得更文静、更娴淑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "7cd8e62216ffaac2c61dcc33eb047c36b5db189030a3ca45b73d58d14753be4d", "ja": "ね、兄ちゃん。\nこんな真美、ヘンだよね？", "zh": "大哥哥，\n真美这样很怪对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "126d934711914ae70ded4692b24e9bbb6f70c60728d67fd7c4ce9b6b6cdba418", "ja": "なるほど……そうか。\nいや、そういうことなら、たぶんヘンじゃないと思う。", "zh": "原来如此……是这样啊。\n如果是这样，那我不会觉得奇怪喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "1891b02b165a2224f30f5c4e3e81bd1945875e0d937d6b80e54448e4a8bd134d", "ja": "え、そうなの？", "zh": "咦？是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2030fefcbc532a558e616aa4a29385cd512325d22d409ff0d6bb72eed7a74841", "ja": "ああ、その服は思った通り、真美によく似合ってて……\nおしとやかにしていると、より可愛くなるからな。", "zh": "是啊，那件衣服就跟我想的一样，非常适合真美……\n行为举止变得娴淑，会让你显得更可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e97ccd13b7d64d182a0b54262fcbc3a6b3e9b5ebb1814a3d65e35773e3a9e11a", "ja": "きっと真美自身も、そう感じてくれてるんだ。\nだから静かにしていたくなるんじゃないか？", "zh": "我想真美也是察觉到这点，\n所以才不会想乱动不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b89f515aa7ca040a0c91b42dde60c170356014fc961ac6f5232848113c0b5f5a", "ja": "真美が一番、可愛くいられるようにって。", "zh": "为了让真美展现自己最可爱的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "f097e011c1046e71d4845b559a7134b5a9c531263b665de588deddd30177c180", "ja": "兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "60441cc9867f95e84edd3100b9076c02ef245ac1b51dd12ea54de35a5b624f8e", "ja": "いいの？　真美をクドいたら、\n捕まるんじゃないの？", "zh": "这样好吗？你要是追真美，\n不是会被警察抓吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c7acbf29724258e37e635aed779c4d1276455545c42b4a3195f750953176f008", "ja": "いやクドいてない！　…けど、カワイイのは本当だよ。\n自慢のアイドルとして、どこにでも送り出せる！", "zh": "谁在追你啊！……不过，你很可爱是真的。\n是我不论送到哪，都能感到自豪的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "a3fe4e5956d36ba194cff4007c9ccfc61665e20609dc1db46873ab8004634cb8", "ja": "……えへへ、そっか～。\nんじゃ、兄ちゃんは……。", "zh": "……嘿嘿，这样啊～\n那么，大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "704dc4ff6cea0d3b251e29fcdda764465bde38123c325d5cbaaccfa852633b68", "ja": "真美が今みたいに、静かにしてた方がいい？", "zh": "你觉得真美应该像现在这样静静不动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_1022", "source_sha256": "e2135978cd828fc7340b0779c6aff8b8e878c3dae21b9df733ec64b9ab34098b", "ja": "よくない", "zh": "不觉得", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6fcd0a118a40c6b302da7fc53ba912a9f811d903c8bc1599298f1ec9dc8bf41c", "ja": "……いや、よくないかな。\n真美にずっと元気がないと、心配になるから。", "zh": "……不，我不觉得。\n看真美一直没有活力，我会担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2001_012mam", "source_sha256": "c8cc7517a5c6c4864b4afe8b4969da8e570168a1cf6512bada52adc3fc5540f8", "ja": "……えへへ、しょうがないな～。わかったよ兄ちゃん！\n真美は兄ちゃんのために、元気出してあげる！", "zh": "……嘿嘿，真拿你没办法～好啦大哥哥！\n真美就为了大哥哥拿出活力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1b33652c810a3ec6af25572de71a646531372b77fcc519bae04e7085779f1d11", "ja": "ああ、よろしく頼む。\nでもたまには、今みたいに大人しいと、より可愛いぞ？", "zh": "嗯，麻烦你了。\n不过，偶尔像现在这样文静一点，会更可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2003_012mam", "source_sha256": "be142405f8cd451a184d242a422a67ab41b0fb585a60299c366700fe15aa6474", "ja": "え～！　そんなややこしいことできないし～！\nぜいたくは敵だよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "咦～！人家哪办得到这么复杂的事情啦～！\n要求太多会出事的，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2004_012mam", "source_sha256": "2a73c88eca6effd245722b9ab1f94244d1dd82ee6432fdb4e6f4cd96d96499ef", "ja": "アナタが落としたノハ、\n元気な真美と大人しい真美の、どっちですカ～？", "zh": "请问你掉的是，\n活泼的真美还是文静的真美～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2005_p", "source_sha256": "36ea88e32453c4ad2a2dad751a8c21aad6f3720f426fbe3c150d1f1f6a539a5c", "ja": "じゃ、じゃあ……元気な真美で。", "zh": "那、那我……选活泼的真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2006_012mam", "source_sha256": "534b6e66c2f0c833629319f02a511148a1dd444fbed31d2999f52d3c51661314", "ja": "イエッサー！　これからもよろしく頼むよ、\n兄ちゃん君♪　あ、それと～。", "zh": "Yes，Sir！今后也请多多指教啰，\n大哥哥♪啊，还有一件事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0084_2007_012mam", "source_sha256": "afd42eb4aeef9b98bd116fb3d772aeb3bcda1598bd37ea4347358fb589a67496", "ja": "真美も兄ちゃんがジマンなんだよ！\n今度ふたりで、誰かにジマンしようね♪", "zh": "大哥哥也是真美自豪的对象喔！\n下次找个人一起炫耀彼此吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
